 a verified completed video. Preparation supports cancellation, retry and recovery after a relo"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ompleted video. Preparation supports cancellation, retry and recovery after a reload. How to use it."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"With **Node.js 22.23.3 or newer**, **DSH 0.1.5-rc.2**, **pnpm 10.28.2** and **Blender 5.2.1** ready:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The two environment options apply only to the install command: they allow pnpm to add the plugin at "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"the profile workspace root and use peers supplied by DSH. They do not change global pnpm settings."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Restart an already running `dsh web` after installation. In a new session, choose the **DeepBlend St"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"udio**\npreset and open **Blender** in the sidebar. Both the workbench and agent presets are included"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"dio**\npreset and open **Blender** in the sidebar. Both the workbench and agent presets are included."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**First time setting up Blender or DSH?** Follow the English / Chinese quick-start guide.\nFFmpeg and"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" ffprobe are needed when encoding an MP4. Install them with `brew install ffmpeg` on macOS,\n`sudo ap"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"t install ffmpeg` on Debian/Ubuntu, or `winget install ffmpeg` on Windows. You can create and render"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" scenes before adding them."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Other install paths and upgrading an existing installation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Prebuilt bundle:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Current source tree:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The quoted `#path:` form keeps the shell from treating `#` as a comment. Source installs may need th"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"e build approval\nreported by DSH; follow that message. **pnpm** must be on `PATH` for every install "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"d approval\nreported by DSH; follow that message. **pnpm** must be on `PATH` for every install route."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Already installed? Replace the existing registration before adding the new package, then restart `ds"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" installed? Replace the existing registration before adding the new package, then restart `dsh web`:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"See the installation and upgrade guide for configuration and storage details."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## New case: Night Shift"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Created through DeepSeek Harness with the installed deep-blend **0.5.0** plugin: Blender’s official "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"CHARGE Packbot, a new industrial set, lighting and six seconds of camera motion. **79 mesh parts, 51"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"1,595 polygons, 19 packed images; 1080p / 24 fps / 144 actually rendered frames.** An independent DS"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"H replay matched the scene digest; the frame-72 preview differed by at most 1/255 per channel."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"播放视频 / Watch · 复现指南 / Replay guide · 完整复现素材 / Replay inputs"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The robot uses the source asset’s static frame-1 pose; the film demonstrates the new set and camera "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"motion. **CHARGE Packbot © Blender Studio / Blender Foundation — CC-BY**; new scene code is MIT. The"},{"id":"p28s3","text":" promotional edit only adds titles and attribution. Release 0.8.1 includes replay inputs under `exam"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ples/charge-study/`; the guide pins the verified 0.5.0 environment."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## New case: Courtyard Pagoda"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The latest case film is a five-shot courtyard pagoda sequence: 37.5 seconds, 900 frames, 24 fps, 128"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"0 × 720, rendered with Cycles at 128 samples. Watch the film and view key frames · Case notes · Asse"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"endered with Cycles at 128 samples. Watch the film and view key frames · Case notes · Asset credits."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Real work: light and material"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Three product studies made with the locally installed DeepBlend plugin: amber glass, a champagne-met"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"al lamp and a speaker with a physical woven grille. Each includes a high-resolution hero, a material"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" close-up and a **6-second / 1080p / 24 fps** camera animation."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| 琥珀时间 · Amber Atlas | 金色暮光 · Solstice | 织声 · Nocturne |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| [](deepblend/docs/assets/showcase/amber-atlas-hero.png) | [](deepblend/docs/assets/showcase/solsti"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ce-hero.png) | [](deepblend/docs/assets/showcase/nocturne-hero.png) |\n| Play MP4 | Play MP4 | Play M"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ero.png) | [](deepblend/docs/assets/showcase/nocturne-hero.png) |\n| Play MP4 | Play MP4 | Play MP4 |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The inline previews sample the actual films at 12 fps; the MP4s retain all 144 rendered frames at 24"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" fps. Click a preview for its 2560×1440 still."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Open the gallery · Scene sources and rebuild · Render provenance · Official Blender visual reference"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"pen the gallery · Scene sources and rebuild · Render provenance · Official Blender visual references"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The scenes and output come from editable SceneSpec and actual rendering. Official Blender examples i"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"nformed the lighting and material direction; no official demo model, texture or movie frame is used "},{"id":"p37s3","text":"in these three product studies."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Why the iteration stays inspectable"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **Saved history.** An accepted edit creates an immutable revision. Restoration moves the current p"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"ointer while keeping the intervening history.\n- **Source-led scenes.** **SceneSpec is the source of "},{"id":"p39s3","text":"truth; `.blend` is a compiled artifact.** Scenes can be rebuilt from the declared inputs and locked "},{"id":"p39s4","text":"resources.\n- **Recoverable delivery.** Frame files are checked rather than trusted from a counter. R"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"esume renders missing or invalid frames; complete frames can proceed directly to encoding.\n- **Expli"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"cit render budgets.** Expensive operations use an approval gate, and the requested scene revision re"},{"id":"p39s7","text":"mains attached to the job.\n- **Separate kinds of evidence.** Technical measurements and image-backed"},{"id":"p39s8","text":" artistic review are distinct; a higher score does not establish a better-looking result."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"Artistic review · Runtime and recovery · Security controls"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

